      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "CustomPrimaryButton di lib/widgets/custom_primary_button.dart: tindakan kuning untuk Pilih Misi, Kirim Jawaban, lanjut puzzle, dan Main Lagi.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\"><span>Kirim Jawaban</span><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;width:100%;min-height:58px;padding:16px 24px;border:0;border-radius:18px;background:#FFCF32;color:#211638;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.ds-primary svg{flex-shrink:0}.ds-primary:hover{background:linear-gradient(rgba(33,22,56,.08),rgba(33,22,56,.08)),#FFCF32}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #7338EA;outline-offset:3px}.ds-primary:active{background:linear-gradient(rgba(33,22,56,.12),rgba(33,22,56,.12)),#FFCF32}.ds-primary:disabled{background:rgba(33,22,56,.10);color:#686174;cursor:default}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-text",
      "description": "Tindakan sekunder di lib/screens/welcome_screen.dart, lib/screens/quiz_screen.dart, dan lib/screens/result_screen.dart untuk sesi, petunjuk, dan pembahasan.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-text-button\">Lihat Pembahasan</button>",
      "css": ".ds-text-button{font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;min-width:48px;min-height:48px;padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-radius:20px;background:transparent;color:#7338EA;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.ds-text-button:hover{background:rgba(115,56,234,.08)}.ds-text-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #7338EA;outline-offset:2px}.ds-text-button:active{background:rgba(115,56,234,.12)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Name Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "name-field",
      "description": "TextFormField di lib/screens/welcome_screen.dart: nama 1-30 karakter, label terpisah, validasi saat submit, dan outline fokus dari lib/utils/app_theme.dart.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\" for=\"ds-name\">Siapa nama kamu?</label><div class=\"ds-field\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 21v-2a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><input id=\"ds-name\" class=\"ds-name\" maxlength=\"30\" placeholder=\"Tulis nama panggilanmu\" autocomplete=\"given-name\"/></div>",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;display:block;margin-bottom:12px;color:#211638;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4}.ds-field{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #E5DFF0;border-radius:16px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#686174}.ds-field svg{flex-shrink:0}.ds-name{font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;width:100%;min-width:0;border:0;padding:0;background:transparent;color:#211638;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;outline:0}.ds-name::placeholder{color:#686174}.ds-field:hover{border-color:#686174}.ds-field:focus-within{outline:2px solid #7338EA;outline-offset:-2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "PuzzleChoice",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Kartu scenario/multiSelect di lib/widgets/puzzle_interactor.dart; contoh state normal dan terpilih. Label, detail, dan ikon menyatakan pilihan. Submit mengunci jawaban. Semantics luar membawa aksi onTap dan enabled; saat terkunci, enabled false dan aksi tap dihapus, termasuk untuk pembaca layar.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-choices\"><button class=\"ds-choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span><strong>Periksa petunjuk bersama</strong><small>Cocokkan bukti sebelum memutuskan.</small></span><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-choice ds-selected\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span><strong>Pilih langkah yang sesuai aturan</strong><small>Gunakan informasi dalam cerita.</small></span><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"m7 12 3 3 7-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7338EA\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-choices{display:grid;gap:12px}.ds-choice{font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;padding:18px;border:1px solid #E5DFF0;border-radius:16px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#211638;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-choice>span{flex:1;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-choice strong{display:block;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4}.ds-choice small{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.ds-choice svg{flex-shrink:0}.ds-selected{border-color:#7338EA;background:#7338EA;color:#FFFFFF}.ds-choice:hover{background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(115,56,234,.08),rgba(115,56,234,.08))}.ds-choice:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #7338EA;outline-offset:3px}.ds-choice:active{background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(115,56,234,.12),rgba(115,56,234,.12))}.ds-choice:disabled{cursor:default}",
      "refersTo": "puzzle-choice"
    },
    {
      "name": "MissionScreen",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Kartu misi di lib/screens/mission_screen.dart; tiga misi dari lib/data/questions.dart, empat puzzle tiap misi. Seluruh kartu memulai misi, footer menawarkan maraton 12 puzzle.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-mission\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4h16v12H4zM12 16v5m-4 0 4-5 4 5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><span><strong>Selamatkan Presentasi</strong><small>Rapikan alur, periksa biaya, dan siapkan tim sebelum tampil.</small><span>4 puzzle</span></span><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-mission{font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;width:100%;padding:22px;border:0;border-radius:16px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#211638;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-mission>svg{flex-shrink:0;color:#7338EA}.ds-mission>svg:last-child{margin-left:-12px}.ds-mission>span{flex:1;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-mission strong{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.3}.ds-mission small{display:block;margin:8px 0;color:#686174;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.ds-mission>span>span{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.ds-mission:hover{background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(115,56,234,.08),rgba(115,56,234,.08))}.ds-mission:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #7338EA;outline-offset:3px}.ds-mission:active{background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(115,56,234,.12),rgba(115,56,234,.12))}",
      "refersTo": "mission-card"
    },
