      "description": "AppHeader di lib/widgets/app_header.dart; judul fleksibel, tanda merek atau kembali, dan tema. Padding header dimiliki lib/widgets/responsive_page.dart.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-header\" aria-label=\"Header aplikasi\"><span class=\"ds-brand\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 10-13h-7l0-7Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-header-title\">Quizora Quest</span><button class=\"ds-theme\" aria-label=\"Aktifkan mode gelap\" title=\"Aktifkan mode gelap\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 14.5A9 9 0 0 1 9.5 4a9 9 0 1 0 10.5 10.5Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-header{font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:16px 0;color:#211638}.ds-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:13px;background:#7338EA;color:#FFFFFF;margin-right:10px}.ds-header-title{flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.3}.ds-theme{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:48px;min-height:48px;padding:12px;border:0;border-radius:24px;background:transparent;color:#7338EA;cursor:pointer}.ds-theme:hover{background:rgba(115,56,234,.08)}.ds-theme:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #7338EA;outline-offset:2px}.ds-theme:active{background:rgba(115,56,234,.12)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Score Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "ResultScreen di lib/screens/result_screen.dart: akurasi percobaan pertama terpisah dari poin permainan, combo terbaik, dan petunjuk. Contoh menggunakan data sintetis.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-score\" aria-label=\"Contoh akurasi 75 persen\"><div class=\"ds-score-number\">75%</div><p class=\"ds-accuracy\">Akurasi percobaan pertama</p><p class=\"ds-correct\">3 dari 4 puzzle benar</p><div class=\"ds-statistics\"><div><strong>310</strong><span>Poin permainan</span></div><div><strong>3</strong><span>Combo terbaik</span></div><div><strong>0</strong><span>Petunjuk</span></div></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-score{font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#7338EA;color:#FFFFFF;text-align:center}.ds-score-number{font-size:72px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.05;color:#FFCF32}.ds-accuracy{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.ds-correct{margin:8px 0 20px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4}.ds-statistics{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:16px 28px;border-top:1px solid #AA7AFF;padding-top:20px}.ds-statistics>div{min-width:0}.ds-statistics strong{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.3}.ds-statistics span{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}",
