      "description": "Progress misi di lib/screens/quiz_screen.dart menghitung attempt terkirim, disertai nomor puzzle dan Semantics answered/total. Contoh satu submit dari empat puzzle.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-progress-label\"><strong>Puzzle 2 / 4</strong><span>100 poin</span></div><div class=\"ds-progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Progress misi\" aria-valuetext=\"1 dari 4\" aria-valuenow=\"1\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"4\"><span class=\"ds-progress-fill\"></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-progress-label{font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;margin-bottom:14px;color:#211638}.ds-progress-label strong{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4}.ds-progress-label span{color:#686174;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.ds-progress{min-height:8px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(115,56,234,.12)}.ds-progress-fill{display:block;width:25%;height:8px;background:#7338EA}"
    },
    {
      "name": "PuzzleInteractor",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Tujuh renderer di lib/widgets/puzzle_interactor.dart: sequence, hotspot, matching, categorize, multiSelect, codeBuilder, scenario. Contoh sequence menunjukkan nomor dan alternatif tombol untuk drag. Token/chip dan slot lain memakai state Material 3. Hotspot membawa selected, enabled, label lengkap, dan aksi onTap pada Semantics luar; saat terkunci, enabled false dan aksi tap dihapus.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sequence\"><span class=\"ds-drag\" aria-label=\"Geser Buat draft\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 5h1v1H9zm5 0h1v1h-1zM9 11h1v1H9zm5 0h1v1h-1zM9 17h1v1H9zm5 0h1v1h-1z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span><strong>1</strong><span class=\"ds-sequence-label\">Buat draft</span><span class=\"ds-move\"><button aria-label=\"Naikkan Buat draft\" disabled><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7 14 5-5 5 5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></button><button aria-label=\"Turunkan Buat draft\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></button></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sequence{font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 4px 8px 12px;border-radius:16px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#211638;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4}.ds-drag{display:flex;padding:8px}.ds-sequence-label{flex:1;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-move{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.ds-move button{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:48px;min-height:48px;padding:12px;border:0;border-radius:24px;background:transparent;color:#7338EA;cursor:pointer}.ds-move button:hover{background:rgba(115,56,234,.08)}.ds-move button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #7338EA;outline-offset:2px}.ds-move button:active{background:rgba(115,56,234,.12)}.ds-move button:disabled{color:#ADA7B8;cursor:default}"
